# UI/UX Pro Max — Karate Hub

When editing UI in `seishin-app`, read and follow the skill at `.cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/SKILL.md`.

## When to activate

- New pages, components, or layout changes
- UX review, accessibility, responsive fixes
- Design system, colors, typography, charts

## Workflow

1. Read `.cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/SKILL.md`
2. Run design searches from project skill folder:

```bash
python .cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py "sports parent dashboard mobile" --design-system -p "Karate Hub"
python .cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py "responsive layout" --stack html-tailwind
```

3. Apply results to existing tokens in `seishin-app/src/index.css` — do not invent a parallel design system.

## Stack

React + Vite + Tailwind CSS v4. Match existing navy/green brand colors unless the user asks for a rebrand.
